  "summary": "从二进制矩阵恰选 numSelect 列，一行所有一所在列都被选中时视为覆盖，求最多覆盖行数。",
  "insight": "列数很小，把每行的一位置编码为位掩码，枚举所有恰有 numSelect 位的列掩码；rowMask 是选择掩码子集时该行被覆盖。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "全零行总被覆盖",
    "必须恰好选择指定列数",
    "子集判断为 (rowMask & selected)==rowMask"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "enumerate-selected-column-masks",
      "title": "枚举选列掩码",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "位运算快速检查每行覆盖关系。",
      "steps": [
        "编码每行 rowMask",
        "枚举 mask=0..2^columns-1 且 bitCount==numSelect",
        "统计满足 (rowMask&mask)==rowMask 的行",
        "返回最大统计"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(2^columns·rows)",
        "space": "O(rows)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/enumerate-selected-column-masks/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/enumerate-selected-column-masks/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/enumerate-selected-column-masks/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
